{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>A huge number of parts make up a car.</strong></u> Each part has its own properties and wear, which affect the car's power, reliability, and sound.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/bbfd904f57c77771a30ebd256753d43f.poster.avif?t=1773089057\" width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/bbfd904f57c77771a30ebd256753d43f.webm?t=1773089057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/bbfd904f57c77771a30ebd256753d43f.mp4?t=1773089057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/870dd4a5b64ae4e453692cf320cb7f07.webp?t=1773089057\" width=900 height=58 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>An entirely interactive car interior with a multimedia system!</strong></u> Press any button, switch the on-board computer's modes, and feel complete control over every function.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/af68f395cfd50aa3def063f9cc34d46e.poster.avif?t=1773089057\" width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/af68f395cfd50aa3def063f9cc34d46e.webm?t=1773089057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/af68f395cfd50aa3def063f9cc34d46e.mp4?t=1773089057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/870dd4a5b64ae4e453692cf320cb7f07.webp?t=1773089057\" width=900 height=58 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Realistic physics:</u></strong> every part has weight and takes up space. There are no invisible inventories here. Everything you find will have to be physically transported in the trunk, loaded onto the roof, or stored in the garage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/51695c2d21beb1901e1cd316b4067ca5.poster.avif?t=1773089057\" width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/51695c2d21beb1901e1cd316b4067ca5.webm?t=1773089057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/51695c2d21beb1901e1cd316b4067ca5.mp4?t=1773089057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/870dd4a5b64ae4e453692cf320cb7f07.webp?t=1773089057\" width=900 height=58 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Survival:</u></strong> keep an eye on your hunger, thirst, and energy. The wastelands are harsh: heat, dust storms, a lack of food and water, and car breakdowns can all derail your journey. Repair your car, scavenge for resources in junkyards and towns, and find food and water to survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/8802348bc000d7f081c60fa3f5957f67.poster.avif?t=1773089057\" width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/8802348bc000d7f081c60fa3f5957f67.webm?t=1773089057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/8802348bc000d7f081c60fa3f5957f67.mp4?t=1773089057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/870dd4a5b64ae4e453692cf320cb7f07.webp?t=1773089057\" width=900 height=58 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>A cozy garage-shelter</strong></u> is your personal space where you can store parts, rest, and take on new jobs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/9dc8d63146c0e64d36e9ee539878f4a3.poster.avif?t=1773089057\" width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/9dc8d63146c0e64d36e9ee539878f4a3.webm?t=1773089057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/9dc8d63146c0e64d36e9ee539878f4a3.mp4?t=1773089057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed car assembly -</strong> assemble the car bolt by bolt: the engine, suspension, body, and interior. <u>Experience real mechanics!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic physics</strong> - the car's behavior depends on the roads, tires, and wear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed engine simulation</strong> - every even most insignificant part is taken into account when the engine is running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open location</strong> - wastelands, villages, and abandoned sites you can drive to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time of day and weather</strong> - heat, dust storms, and a neon-lit metropolis at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactivity</strong> - every button, switch, and lever in the game works. No decorations, only functionality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garage and tuning</strong> - turn your garage into a dream workshop: customize parts, paint the body, use tools, and experiment with chip tuning.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/870dd4a5b64ae4e453692cf320cb7f07.webp?t=1773089057\" width=900 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Back To Drive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is a game about the love of cars, creativity, and the desire to do everything with your own hands. There are no levels or conditional upgrades here\u2014only real mechanics, real work, and the feeling that every detail matters.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3942400?t=1773089057","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/5f0853396cce17f42bee8858e6677e2b804e05d0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773089057","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/4c20f355998e798391b82518e482c57cec29ae61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773089057","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/4c20f355998e798391b82518e482c57cec29ae61/capsule_184x69.jpg?