r breakdowns can all derail your journey. Repair your car, scavenge for resources in junkyards and towns, and find food and water to survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/8802348bc000d7f081c60fa3f5957f67.poster.avif?t=1773089057\" width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/8802348bc000d7f081c60fa3f5957f67.webm?t=1773089057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/8802348bc000d7f081c60fa3f5957f67.mp4?t=1773089057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/870dd4a5b64ae4e453692cf320cb7f07.webp?t=1773089057\" width=900 height=58 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>A cozy garage-shelter</strong></u> is your personal space where you can store parts, rest, and take on new jobs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/9dc8d63146c0e64d36e9ee539878f4a3.poster.avif?t=1773089057\" width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/9dc8d63146c0e64d36e9ee539878f4a3.webm?t=1773089057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942400/extras/9dc8d63146c0e64d36e9ee539878f4a3.mp4?t=1773089057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"